ding","text":"Initialize the SDK","anchor":"Initialize-the-SDK","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The PSReader SDK must be globally initialized before it can be used. Call this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"method early in your app lifecycle to optimize reader launch speed. You only"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"need to call this method once."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The completion handler is only used to return a status flag. It is not required"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and it is not necessary to wait for the completion handler before continuing."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This method will only fail if the API key is invalid."}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import PSReader","","PSReader.initialize(apiKey: apiKey, completion: { success in","    \/\/ Note: The completion handler may be called on any thread.","})"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"async"},{"type":"text","text":" overload is available for apps using Swift concurrency:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["await PSReader.initialize(apiKey: apiKey)"]},{"type":"heading","text":"Choose Your Integration Level","anchor":"Choose-Your-Integration-Level","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"With the SDK initialized, pick your path:"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Prebuilt UI"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" — ship a complete, themeable reader experience around"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/CarouselViewController"},{"type":"text","text":" with minimal integration work. Most apps start"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text